---
description: Explain each idea and wait for a go-ahead before changing the project
alwaysApply: true
---

When Carlos shares an idea, explain it first. Describe what it would change and how it would work.

Do not edit project files, commit, push, or open a pull request for that idea until Carlos gives a clear go-ahead.

Do not commit idea work directly to `main`. After a go-ahead, put the change on a feature branch and a pull request so Carlos can review it before it reaches `main`.
